sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Maintainer
    participant G as GitLab CE
    participant R as Runner manager
    participant J as Deployment job
    participant C as Controller
    participant T as Target
    M->>G: Release manual job for reviewed commit
    R->>G: Poll for ready jobs
    G-->>R: Job assignment
    R->>J: Start job container
    J->>C: Pinned SSH request to ctl-run
    C->>G: Fetch exact commit with deploy token
    C->>C: Claim pipeline request before execution
    C->>T: Run Ansible over SSH or WinRM
    T-->>C: Playbook result
    C-->>J: Execution exit code
    J->>C: Retrieve result archive over SSH
    C-->>J: Run record and available results
    J->>G: Upload artifacts and job status
